WEBVTT

00:04:58.038 --> 00:05:01.163
And if there's any issues
that she experiences in her program,

00:05:01.204 --> 00:05:02.371
any violation,

00:05:02.413 --> 00:05:04.704
she shares this information
with the state,

00:05:04.746 --> 00:05:06.746
and the state makes it publicly available.

00:05:06.788 --> 00:05:07.954
To make this work,

00:05:07.954 --> 00:05:11.163
we've got to make sure it's easy
for parents to get this information

00:05:11.204 --> 00:05:13.538
when they're making a decision
for their children.

00:05:13.579 --> 00:05:14.746
Along with this,

00:05:14.788 --> 00:05:17.204
we need more information
about Christina's program.

00:05:17.246 --> 00:05:19.371
What's her background,
what's her philosophy?

00:05:19.413 --> 00:05:20.871
What are her tuition rates?

00:05:20.913 --> 00:05:22.538
Who else is in the program?

00:05:22.538 --> 00:05:24.413
Is she operating a safe program?

00:05:24.454 --> 00:05:26.454
Is this a program parents can trust?

00:05:26.496 --> 00:05:27.663
Along with this,

00:05:27.663 --> 00:05:29.788
what do other parents think
about the program

00:05:29.788 --> 00:05:31.663
who have been enrolled in the program?